{%- comment -%}
  Maler-beregner treatment configuration.
  Maps each treatment to required products, coverage rates, and tool sets.

  Structure per treatment:
    - coverage_m2_per_liter: how many m² one liter covers
    - coats: number of coats needed
    - note: optional callout shown above the result list (e.g. "new gypsum needs 2 coats")
    - steps: optional ordered work sequence shown under the note
    - products: array of product bundles
      - handle: Shopify product handle
      - role: what the product does (primer, paint, tool, accessory)
      - per_m2: quantity needed per m² PER COAT (0 = flat quantity regardless of area)
      - flat_qty: fixed quantity regardless of area (e.g. 1 tray, 1 roll of tape)
      - unit: display unit for the quantity ("L" default for per_m2, "stk" for flat_qty,
              also "m" for lining fabric/tape and "kg" for adhesive)
      - apply_coats: false = quantity is NOT multiplied by coats (filt, glue, filler,
              anything applied once). Defaults to true, so paint/primer scale with coats.
      - pack_size / pack_unit: optional, converts the quantity into whole packs,
              e.g. pack_size 25 + pack_unit "rulle" => "440 m (18 ruller à 25 m)"
      - variant: optional variant title to pick instead of the first one, e.g. "50mm"
{%- endcomment -%}

